# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  HONO Sales OS — one-time configuration. Edit, then launch.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# WHERE YOUR PROPOSALS LIVE (client folders + base template).
# For the whole TEAM to share one archive, point this at a OneDrive /
# SharePoint-synced folder that everyone has synced locally, e.g.:
#   HONO_PROJECT_DIR="$HOME/Library/CloudStorage/OneDrive-HONO/Proposal Generation"
# For solo use, the default below is fine.
HONO_PROJECT_DIR="$HOME/Claude/Projects/Proposal Generation"

# Base template file (defaults to the SIM full-suite template inside the folder above).
# HONO_TEMPLATE="$HONO_PROJECT_DIR/HONO_HCM Proposal_01072026_SIM_FullHRMSSuite.docx"

# PORTAL LIBRARIES — RFP Library and Sales Assets. By default they sit next to
# the Proposal Generation folder (same shared drive), created automatically.
# HONO_ROOT="$(dirname "$HONO_PROJECT_DIR")"
# HONO_RFP_DIR="$HONO_ROOT/RFP Library"
# HONO_ASSETS_DIR="$HONO_ROOT/Sales Assets"

# TEAM PASSWORD (recommended if others will reach this over the network).
# Leave blank for open localhost-only use. Username defaults to "team".
HONO_PASSWORD=""
HONO_USER="team"

# NETWORK REACH:
#   127.0.0.1  = only this Mac can open it (most private)
#   0.0.0.0    = teammates on the same office network can open it at http://<this-mac-ip>:8765
HONO_HOST="127.0.0.1"

HONO_PORT="8765"

# LibreOffice (for PDF preview). Default macOS path shown; usually no change needed.
# HONO_SOFFICE="/Applications/LibreOffice.app/Contents/MacOS/soffice"
